            "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line012",
            "quote": "宣帝九男，穆張皇后生景帝、文帝、平原王幹，伏夫人生汝南文成王亮、琅邪武王伷、清惠亭侯京、扶風武王駿，張夫人生梁王肜，柏夫人生趙王倫。亮及倫別有傳。",
            "person_mention_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line012:m0036"
          },
          {
            "work_id": "w-jinshu",
            "book_id": "b-jinshu-038",
            "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family",
            "source_id": "s-jinshu-038-langye-near-family",
            "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line028",
            "quote": "伷既戚屬尊重，加有平吳之功，克己恭儉，無矜滿之色，僚吏盡力，百姓懷化。疾篤，賜床帳、衣服、錢帛、秔梁等物，遣侍中問焉。太康四年薨，時年五十七。臨終表求葬母太妃陵次，並乞分國封四子，帝許之。子恭王覲立。又封次子澹為武陵王，繇為東安王，漼為淮陵王。",
            "person_mention_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line028:m0097"
          },
          {
            "work_id": "w-jinshu",
            "book_id": "b-jinshu-038",
            "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family",
            "source_id": "s-jinshu-038-langye-near-family",
            "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p001",
            "quote": "覲字思祖，拜冗從僕射。太熙元年薨，時年三十五。子睿立，是為元帝。",
            "person_mention_id": "c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p001:m0024"
          },
          {
            "work_id": "w-jinshu",
            "book_id": "b-jinshu-064",
            "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons",
            "source_id": "s-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons",
            "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons:p001",
